stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PRIMARY_SENT: STOP or PAID verdict<br/>(parent told first)
  PRIMARY_SENT --> ACKED: child taps "Saya uruskan"
  PRIMARY_SENT --> SECONDARY_SENT: +180 s, no ack,<br/>second contact exists
  PRIMARY_SENT --> UNACKED: +180 s, no ack,<br/>no second contact
  SECONDARY_SENT --> ACKED: either contact taps<br/>"Saya uruskan"
  SECONDARY_SENT --> UNACKED: +180 s, no ack
  UNACKED --> [*]: parent re-told to call<br/>bank / 997
  ACKED --> [*]: chain stops,<br/>nobody else pinged
  note right of PRIMARY_SENT
    Every move is a conditional
    DynamoDB update, so a late
    timer or a double tap does nothing.
    Cap: two contacts.
  end note
